WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.620
Hello everybody!

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:03.380
My name is Markiplier and welcome to Sacramento!

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:07.060
Now Sacramento is a really interesting looking game

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:08.620
and I mean that quite literally

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:13.000
I don't usually judge games by just it's looks alone

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:16.020
This one in particular is so fascinating

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.840
Because it blends together 2D styling

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:21.500
in this really cartoonish and jittery way

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:23.780
in a 3D world

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:28.660
and I've never played it before and I know this concept is not new

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:31.980
But the way that its presented itself is just so interesting

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:35.940
Because it says that it's a game about exploration and discovery

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:39.120
and again that's not a new concept but

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:41.860
I don't know, something about this game seems intriguing to me

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:42.780
(Mark screams) Hello

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:47.220
